B.Ut=new A.ec("mirrorImage","PHB","While this condition is active, each time a creature targets the caster with an attack, the caster must roll a d20 to determine whether the attack instead targets one of the caster\u2019s duplicates.\n\n- If the caster has three duplicates, a roll of 6 or higher causes the attack to target a duplicate.\n- If the caster has two duplicates, a roll of 8 or higher is required.\n- If the caster has one duplicate, a roll of 11 or higher is required.\n\nEach duplicate has an Armor Class equal to 10 + the caster\u2019s Dexterity modifier. If an attack hits a duplicate, that duplicate is destroyed.\n\nA duplicate can only be destroyed by an attack that successfully hits it. Duplicates are unaffected by all other damage and effects.\n\nThis condition ends when all duplicates are destroyed.",B.ok,B.c8)
